  "エンコーダーすき間のある円板が回ると、光が通ったりさえぎられたりしてパルスが出ます。パルスを数えると回った量、時間あたりの数で速さがわかります。": "When the disc between the encoder and the housing rotates, the light passes through or is distorted and pulses are produced. When counting pulses, the speed is determined by the number of rounds and the number of pulses per time.",
