  "オンディレイは電源を入れてから設定時間後にa接点が閉じます。電源オフディレイは電源を入れるとすぐ閉じます。電源を切ったあとも内部に蓄えた電気で時間を数え、設定時間後に開きます。波形が高い区間は、上が電源「入」、下が接点「閉」です。": "On delay is when a contact closes after a set time after power is turned on. Power off delay closes immediately when power is turned on. After the power is turned off, the timer counts the time with the electricity stored inside, and opens after the set time. The high waveform section is the power \"in\" at the top and the contact \"close\" at the bottom.",
