  "コイル": "Coil",
  "コイルに電気が入ると電磁石になり、鉄のプランジャを引き上げて弁が開き、水が流れます。電気が切れるとばねで閉じます。": "When electricity enters the coil, it becomes an electromagnet, and the iron plug is pulled up, the valve opens, and water flows. It closes with a spring when the power is cut off.",
