  "コンプレッサー": "Compressor",
  "コンプレッサーと圧力スイッチ": "Compressor and pressure switch",
  "コンプレッサーと圧力スイッチ空気を圧縮してタンクにためます。圧力スイッチが0.8MPaで止め、0.6MPaまで下がるとまた動かします。上がりすぎたときに逃がすのが安全弁です。": "The compressor and pressure switch compress the air and put it into the tank. The pressure switch is stopped at 0.8MPa and moved again when the pressure drops to 0.6MPa. The safety valve is used to release the valve when the pressure is too high.",
  "コンプレッサーは圧力スイッチで自動的に止まったり動いたりする": "The compressor is automatically stopped or started by a pressure switch.",
