  "シリンダースイッチ": "Cylinder switch",
  "シリンダースイッチ(ピストンの磁石に反応するリードスイッチ)で端に着いたことを知り、電磁弁を切り替えて往復させます。": "The cylinder switch (a lead switch that reacts to the magnet of the piston) knows that it has reached the end, and switches the solenoid valve to move back and forth.",
  "シリンダースイッチで端に着いたことを知り、自動で往復できる": "The cylinder switches know that they have reached the end, and they can automatically return.",
