  "タイマー": "Timer",
  "タイマー2個がお互いを切り替え合うと、点滅が続く": "When two timers switch on and off, they will continue to flash.",
  "タイマー2個で順番に動く盤です。起動を押すと、まずランプ、T1の時間後にファン、さらにT2の時間後にブザーが鳴ります。": "It is a plate that moves in sequence with two timers. When you press start, the lamp sounds first, the fan sounds after a time of T1, and the buzzer sounds after another time of T2.",
  "タイマー3個のバトンリレーで、信号が一周した": "The signal was sent around the three-timer baton relay.",
  "タイマー3個のリレー競走。青 → 黄 → 赤 → 青…と順番にくり返す": "Three timers repeat the traffic-light sequence: green → yellow → red → green.",
  "タイマーT1の設定時間が経つと、ファンが回り始めます。": "After the set time of timer T1, the fan starts to rotate.",
  "タイマーが登場。R1が入るとタイマーが数え始め、時間になると接点が閉じてファンが回ります。": "The timer is introduced. When R1 is entered, the timer starts counting, and when the time is set, the contact closes and the fan turns.",
