  "テストボタンを押すと、中でわざと小さな漏電を起こして、ちゃんと切れるかを確かめられます。機器の取扱説明書で点検時期と手順を確認します。": "Pressing the test button will cause a small leak inside the device to check if it will shut down properly. The inspection time and procedure are verified in the operating manual of the equipment.",
