  "トイレの換気扇の回路です。": "This is the circuit of the toilet fan.",
  "トイレの換気扇の回路です。照明スイッチを切っても、オフディレイタイマーのおかげでファンはしばらく回り続けます。": "This is the circuit of the toilet fan. Even if you turn off the light switch, the fan will keep turning for a while thanks to the off delay timer.",
  "トランジスタを高速で入り切りして、": "I'm going to get through the transistor at high speed.",
  "トランス": "Trance",
  "トランス1次": "Trance 1",
  "トランス2次": "Trance 2",
  "トランス:1次側のコイルに交流を流すと鉄心に磁気の変化が生まれ、2次側のコイルに電圧が生まれます(電磁誘導)。電圧は巻数の比で決まり、500回:120回なら100V→24Vです。プラグを抜いて、Ωで1次の端子と2次の端子の間を測ってみましょう。": "Transformer: When an alternating current is flowed into the first-order coil, a change in the magnetism of the iron core is produced and a voltage is produced in the second-order coils (electromagnetic induction). The voltage is determined by the ratio of the number of coils, and if 500 coils: 120 coils, the voltage is 100V→24V. Let us unplug the plug and measure the difference between the first and second terminals in Ω.",
  "トランスと直流電源": "Transformers and DC power supplies",
  "トランスの2次側のコイルが切れていました。2次側が0Vだったはずです。": "The second coil of the trance was cut off. The second side must have been 0V.",
  "トランスの2次側は24V。巻数の比(500:120)で電圧が下がる": "The secondary is 24 V. The 500:120 turns ratio steps down the voltage.",
