  "体に流れる電流危険の程度は電流の大きさ・流れた時間・体を通る経路などで変わります。グラフの帯は人体電流の影響を示す目安です。漏電ブレーカーの感度は、体に流してよい電流を示す値ではありません。": "The degree of danger of the current flowing into the body varies by the size of the current, the time flowed, and the path through the body, etc. The bands of the graph are guidelines showing the effect of the human body current. The sensitivity of the leakage breaker is not a value that indicates the current that flows well into the body.",
