  "信号の部屋(4-20mA)": "Signal room (4-20mA)",
  "信号の部屋です。水槽の水位を水位計(変換器)が測り、4-20mAの電流にして遠くの表示器まで送ります。表示器の手前の250Ωの抵抗で、電流は1-5Vの電圧に変わります。まず水位を0%から100%まで動かしてみよう。": "It's the signal room. The water level in the tank is measured by a water level meter (transducer) and transmitted to a distant display with a current of 4-20mA. The current is changed to a voltage of 1-5V by a 250Ω resistor in front of the display. First, let's move the water level from 0% to 100%.",
