  "停止ボタン(押すと切れるb接点)と停止ランプが増えました。起動を押して離してみよう。点いたままになります。": "The stop button (b contact which is cut off by pressing) and the stop lamp have been added. Let's try to push the start button and unplug it. It will remain dotted.",
