  "停止（PB2）を離し、赤だけが点いたままか確認してください。": "Release the stop (PB2) and make sure that only the red remains lit.",
  "停止（PB2）を離してください。赤の停止灯だけが点き、ファンが止まるとクリアです。": "Unplug the stop (PB2). Only the red stop light is lit, and the fan is clear when it stops.",
  "停電": "Power outage",
  "停電してもダブルソレノイドの弁は流路を保ち、空気があればロッドは動き続ける": "The double solenoid valve keeps the flow path even when the power is cut, and the rod keeps moving as long as there is air.",
  "停電しても弁は": "And if the power goes out, the valves will work.",
  "停電しても弁は直前の流路を保ちます。空気の力が十分なら、途中にあるロッドはその方向へ動き続けます。": "The valve keeps the flow path just before the power failure. If the air force is sufficient, the rods in the middle will continue to move in that direction.",
  "停電するとシングルソレノイドはばねで戻る": "When power is cut off, the single solenoid springs back.",
  "停電すると弁は": "When the power goes out, the valves are shut down.",
  "停電すると弁はばねで戻り側に切り替わります。残った空気の力が十分なら、伸びていたロッドは戻ります。": "When power is cut off, the valve switches to the return side by a spring. If the remaining air is enough, the extending rod will return.",
