  "力 = 圧力 × 面積": "Force = pressure × area",
  "力 = 圧力 × 面積φ40のシリンダーのピストンの面積は約1257mm²。0.5MPa(=1mm²あたり0.5N)なら 0.5×1257 ≒ 628N(約64kgf)の理論上の力で押します。戻るときはロッドの分だけ面積が小さく(約1056mm²)、力も小さくなります。": "Force = pressure × area. A 40 mm bore has about 1257 mm² of piston area. At 0.5 MPa (0.5 N per mm²) the theoretical extension force is 0.5 × 1257 ≈ 628 N (about 64 kgf). On return, the rod reduces the effective area to about 1056 mm², so force is lower.",
  "力=圧力×面積。圧力が低いと重い荷物を押せない": "The force = pressure x area. Low pressure means you can't push heavy loads.",
  "力が足りず動けない!": "I can't move!",
  "加速・減速": "Acceleration and deceleration",
  "加速・減速加速時間が短すぎると電流が増えすぎて過電流(OC)、重い物を急に止めると、モーターが発電機になって電気が戻り過電圧(OV)で止まります。": "If the acceleration and deceleration time is too short, the current increases too much and overcurrent (OC) occurs, and if heavy objects are stopped abruptly, the motor becomes a generator, the electricity returns and stops with overvoltage (OV).",
  "加速時間": "Acceleration time",
  "加速時間が短すぎると、インバータが過電流(OC)で止まる": "If the acceleration time is too short, the inverter will stop with overcurrent (OC).",
  "加速時間が短すぎると電流が増えすぎて": "If the acceleration time is too short, the current is too high.",
  "動く物が": "There's something moving.",
  "動く物がローラー付きレバーに当たるとレバーが倒れ、中のプランジャを押して接点を切り替えます。シャッターでは上限と下限に付けて、端で自動的に止めています。": "When a moving object hits the lever with rollers, the lever falls down and the plug inside is pressed to switch the contact. The shutter is set to the upper and lower limits and automatically stops at the edge.",
  "動力線 200V(モーター用)": "Power line 200V (for motor)",
  "動力線と並べる": "Align with the power line.",
  "動力線と並べると、電圧信号はふらつくが、電流信号はほとんど影響を受けない": "The voltage signal is blurred, but the current signal is hardly affected.",
  "半導体(サイリスタなど)で電気の通り道を開け閉め": "The semiconductors (cylinders, etc.) open and close the electrical path.",
  "危険": "Dangerous",
  "危険の程度は": "How dangerous is it?",
  "危険時に機械を止めます。停止後は原因を取り除き、安全を確認してロックを解除します。実機の再始動には別の起動操作が必要です。": "Stop the machine when it is dangerous. After the shutdown, the cause is removed, the security is verified, and the lock is unlocked. A separate boot operation is required to restart the actual machine.",
  "原因(過負荷・欠相)を取り除いてから": "The cause of the failure is not known.",
