  "同じところ同士なので、つないでも変わりません。": "They are in the same place, so they don't change if you connect them.",
  "同じ大きさ": "Same size.",
  "周期が短いほど、同じ時間にリレーを開閉する回数が増えます。実機の寿命は負荷電流や開閉条件で変わります。「接点溶着を再現」では、接点が閉じたままになる故障を試せます。": "The shorter the cycle, the more times the relay is opened and closed at the same time. The life of the actual machine varies with the load current and the opening and closing condition. In \"Reproduction of contact soldering\", the fault that the contact remains closed can be tested.",
