  "回": "Round",
  "回して操作するスイッチです。この盤は、手を離しても選んだ位置を保つ2位置のタイプです。": "This is a switch you can turn to operate. This plate is a two-position type that keeps the chosen position even when the hand is removed.",
  "回路を": "I'm going to get the circuit.",
