  "始動 0秒": "Start 0 seconds.",
  "始動のたびに流れる": "It's always on when you start.",
  "始動のたびに流れる大きな電流でコイルが熱くなり、冷める前にまた始動したり、回りきれないまま電流を流し続けたので、コイルの絶縁が焼けてしまいました。熱は電流の2乗に比例するので、電流が6倍なら熱は36倍。大きなモーターの始動電流を小さくするのはこのためです。実物ではサーマルリレーで守ります。": "The coil was heated by the large current flowing every time it started, and it started again before it cooled, or it continued to flow the current without turning, and the insulation of the coil was burned. Since heat is proportional to the square of the current, if the current is 6 times, heat is 36 times. This is why the starting current of large motors is reduced. In the actual case, it is protected by a thermal relay.",
