  "寸動(インチング):切替スイッチで自己保持を切ると、少しずつ動かせる": "Inching: When self-retention is turned off with a switch, the device moves little by little.",
  "寸動:自己保持を切ると、押している間だけ少しずつ動かせる": "Move: When self-retention is turned off, the mouse moves little by little while you are holding it down.",
  "導通": "Dutong",
