  "導通チェック:つながっていると「ピー」と鳴る": "Connection check: sounds 'P' when connected",
  "導通チェックつながっていれば(抵抗が小さければ)ピーと鳴ります。断線を探すのに便利です。これも電源を切ってから。": "If the conductance check is connected (if the resistance is small), it sounds a beep. This is useful for finding a broken wire. This is after the power is off.",
  "小さなモーターなら直入れでも問題ありませんが、大きなモーターでは電圧が下がって": "It's fine to plug a small motor straight in, but a large motor will have a drop in voltage.",
  "小さなモーターなら直入れでも問題ありませんが、大きなモーターでは電圧が下がってほかの機械に影響したり、配線や電源に負担がかかります。": "If the motor is small, it is not a problem to plug it directly, but if the motor is large, the voltage will fall and affect other machines, or the wiring and power supply will be burdened.",
  "小さな漏電では切れません": "It won't be cut off by a small leak.",
  "小さな電気で、たくさんの接点をまとめて切り替える部品。リレー回路の主役です。": "A part that switches with a small electrical device, and which combines many contacts. It is the main role of the relay circuit.",
  "展開接続図": "Expansion diagram",
  "展開接続図がお手本": "The unfolding connection diagram is shown.",
  "展開接続図がお手本です。図と盤で同じ番号の線を見比べ、間違った線を外して正しい端子につなぎ直そう。直したら、起動と停止を試して動きを確かめよう。": "The unfolding connection diagram is a model. Compare the lines with the same number in the diagram and the plate, remove the wrong line and connect it to the right terminal. After fixing it, we will try to start and stop it to see if it moves.",
  "展開接続図で": "I'm going to show you a diagram of the connections.",
  "展開接続図でPB1（左手）とPB2（右手）を見つけ、どこまで電気が通るか比べてみよう。実機の両手操作装置では、左右を押す時間差や再起動の条件も監視します。": "In the unfolded connection diagram, find PB1 (left hand) and PB2 (right hand), and compare how far the electricity passes. In the two-handed control device of the actual machine, the time difference between pressing the left and right buttons and the condition of restart are also monitored.",
  "展開接続図と盤の配線を見比べて、つなぎ先が違う線を2本見つけよう": "Compare the diagram with the panel and find the two wires connected to the wrong terminals.",
  "左が+24V、右が0Vです。2本のバーの間は絶縁されています。": "The left is +24V, the right is 0V. The two bars are insulated.",
  "左に回した（開）": "Turned left.",
  "左はつまみの正面、右は中のしくみです。つまみと一緒に": "The left is the front of the thumb, and the right is the inside. With a little bit of luck.",
  "左はつまみの正面、右は中のしくみです。つまみと一緒にカムが回ります。右に回すとカムが押し棒を押し、可動接点が端子1と2を橋渡しします。左に戻すとばねが押し棒を戻し、接点が開きます。": "The left is the front of the thumb, and the right is the inside. The cams rotate with the pin. When the cam is turned to the right, it pushes the push rod, and the movable contact bridges terminals 1 and 2. If you turn it back to the left, the spring will push the push rod back and the contact will open.",
  "左は主回路1相分の例です。モーターの電流がヒーターを温め、過負荷が続くと": "The left is an example of the main circuit 1 phase. The current from the motor heats up the heater, and the overload continues.",
  "左は主回路1相分の例です。モーターの電流がヒーターを温め、過負荷が続くとバイメタルが曲がってトリップ棒を押します。その動きで右の補助接点が切り替わります。この盤は、冷めてからリセットする手動復帰式です。": "The left is an example of the main circuit 1 phase. The current of the motor heats the heater, and if the overload continues, the bimetal bends and pushes the tripping rod. The right auxiliary contact is switched by this movement. This plate is a manual reset plate that is reset after cooling.",
