  "抵抗 Ωテスターの電池で小さな電流を流して、流れにくさを測ります。電源を切ってから測ります。OLは「測れないほど大きい(つながっていない)」という意味です。": "Resistance Ω tester is used to measure the resistance of a material by running a small current through the battery. I'll take the measurement after the power is off. OL means \"so large that it cannot be measured (not connected)\".",
