  "機械が決まった位置まで来たことを知らせるスイッチ。人の代わりに": "A switch that informs the machine that it has reached a fixed position. Instead of people.",
  "機械が決まった位置まで来たことを知らせるスイッチ。人の代わりに機械自身が押すボタンです。": "A switch that informs the machine that it has reached a fixed position. It's a button that the machine itself presses instead of the human.",
  "機械です。出力側には電気を受け止める回路がなく、そこに電源を入れると": "It's a machine. There is no circuit on the output side to receive electricity, so you put power on it.",
