  "温調器": "Thermostat",
  "温調器、モーター、テスター、4-20mA、漏電、センサー、空気圧などの機器を部屋ごとに触って、原理を学びます。間違った使い方をすると壊れて、その理由がわかります。": "The principle of the thermostat, motor, tester, 4-20mA, leakage, sensor, air pressure, etc. is learned by touching the equipment in each room. If you use it wrong, it breaks, and you know why.",
  "温調器の読み(PV)": "Thermostat reading (PV)",
  "温調器はヒーターを入り切りしますが、ヒーターの大きな電流は温調器では流せないので、間に": "The thermostat is connected to the heater, but the large current of the heater cannot be flowed by the thermostat, so the thermostat is in between.",
  "温調器・SSR": "Thermostat",
  "測って故障の場所を見つけた!": "We've measured it and found the fault!",
  "測ります。": "I'll measure it.",
  "測ります。OLは「測れないほど大きい(つながっていない)」という意味です。": "I'll measure it. OL means \"so large that it cannot be measured (not connected)\".",
  "測ります。この教材ではプラグを抜き、OFFのスイッチの両端にリードを当ててからプラグを差すと、ランプと直列になります。": "I'll measure it. In this tutorial, the plug is unplugged, leads are placed on both ends of the OFF switch, and the plug is inserted, so that it is in line with the lamp.",
  "測ります。テスターの中はほぼ0Ωなので、電圧のかかった2点に当てると…": "I'll measure it. The tester is almost zero Ω, so if you put it on two points that are voltaged...",
