  "現場と事務所の": "The scene and the office.",
  "現場と事務所の2か所にボタンがある換気ファンの盤です。起動ボタンは並列(どちらでも入る)、停止ボタンは直列(どちらでも切れる)につないであります。": "It is a fan plate with buttons in two places in the field and the office. The start button is connected to a parallel (which can be entered either way) and the stop button is connecting to a straight (which may be cut either way).",
  "現状調査から設計・現場の試運転までご相談いただけます。": "We can advise you from the present state investigation to the design and the test run in the field.",
