  "空の盤から自己保持回路を完成させた。起動を離しても緑が点き、停止を押すと赤に戻った": "The self-maintaining circuit is completed from the empty plate. Green light when I let go of start, red again when I shut down.",
  "空気を圧縮してタンクにためます。": "The air is compressed and put into the tank.",
  "空気圧": "Air pressure",
  "空気圧の部屋": "Pressurized air chamber",
  "空気圧の部屋です。電磁弁のボタンを押すと、空気がシリンダーに入ってロッドが伸びて荷物を押します。圧力やスピードコントローラーを変えて、力と速さの変化を見よう。": "It's a pressurized room. When the button of the solenoid valve is pressed, air enters the cylinder and the rod extends and pushes the load. Let's change the pressure and speed controllers and see the change in force and speed.",
  "空焚きでヒーターが焼き切れました": "The heater burned out.",
  "端子": "Terminal",
  "端子 → 端子": "Terminal → Terminal",
  "端子がゆるむと、そこだけ熱くなる": "If the terminals loosen, it gets just as hot.",
  "端子のねじ": "Terminal screw",
  "端子のねじが": "There's a screw on the terminal.",
  "端子のねじがゆるみました(振動や熱で少しずつゆるむことがあります)。触れている面積が小さくなり、そこだけ電気が通りにくくなります。": "The screw on the terminal is loose (it may loosen a little bit due to vibration or heat). The smaller the surface area that is touched, the more difficult it is for electricity to pass through.",
  "端子のゆるみ": "Loose terminals",
  "端子のゆるみねじがゆるむと触れている面積が減って接触抵抗が増え、そこだけ熱くなります。熱でさらに酸化してゆるみが進み、最後は火花や火災に。サーモカメラで発熱を点検できます。実機でねじを締めるときは電源を切り、指定トルクに従います。": "The contact resistance increases as the contact area decreases when the loose screw of the terminal loosens, and the heat increases as a result. The heat further oxidized and the looseness progressed, and eventually resulted in sparks and fires. Thermal cameras can be used to inspect the heat generation. When tightening a screw in the actual machine, the power is switched off and the specified torque is followed.",
  "端子の温度": "Terminal temperature",
