  "見えない電気を数字で": "We're going to figure out how to make the invisible electricity work.",
  "見つけるセンサー。": "Find the sensor.",
  "触って、動かして、ときどき壊して覚える学習ソフトです。どちらから始めても大丈夫。まずはリレーのカチッという音から。": "This is a learning software that you can learn by touching, moving, and sometimes breaking. You can start from either. First, the clicking sound of the relay.",
