  "記録を読み込む": "Load Record",
  "設定値": "Set value",
  "設定値が定格より低いと、普段の運転でも切れてしまう": "If the setting value is lower than the rating, it will be switched off even during normal operation.",
  "設定値サーマルのダイヤルは、モーターの定格電流(銘板の値、ここでは9A)に合わせます。高すぎると守れず、低すぎると普段の運転でも切れます。": "The dial of the set value thermal is adjusted to the rated current of the motor (the value on the plate, in this case 9A). If it is too high, it will not protect, and if it is too low, it will break even in normal driving.",
  "設定時間": "Setting time",
  "許容電流": "Permissible current",
  "許容電流のめやす": "Allowable current decrease",
  "許容電流近くまで流すと、電線は60℃近くまで熱くなる": "When the current is flowed to near the permissible current, the wire is heated to near 60℃.",
  "許容電流電流が流れると電線は電流の2乗に比例して熱を生じます。被覆(ビニール)が耐えられる温度から決めた、流してよい電流が許容電流です。この表は周囲30℃以下、被覆の許容温度60℃のビニルコードの例です。種類や敷設条件によって値は変わります。": "Wire current rating. Heating is proportional to current squared. The allowable current is limited by the insulation temperature. This table is an example for flexible PVC cord at ambient temperatures up to 30 °C with a 60 °C insulation limit. Cable type and installation conditions affect the value.",
  "試験電圧": "Test voltage",
  "誘導モーターを止まった状態で電源につなぐと、回転する磁界と回転子の速度差（すべり）が最大になり、大きな始動電流が流れます。この教材では": "When the inductive motor is connected to the power supply in the stopped state, the difference in speed (slip) between the rotating magnetic field and the rotor is maximized, and a large starting current flows. This material is not a textbook .",
  "誘導形の近接センサーは鉄に反応する": "The inductive proximity sensor reacts to iron.",
  "読み込めませんでした。この教材で書き出したJSONファイルを選んでください。": "Could not load. Select the JSON file you wrote in this tutorial.",
  "警報 右": "Alert right.",
  "警報 左": "Alert left.",
