  "踏切": "Crosswalk",
  "踏切(遮断機)": "Step-off (circuit breaker)",
  "踏切です。接近ボタンで警報開始、通過ボタンで解除。点滅回路と自己保持の組み合わせです。": "It's a crosswalk. The alarm is started by the approach button and is disabled by the pass button. It is a combination of a flashing circuit and self-maintenance.",
  "踏切完成! 警報が鳴って遮断機が下りた": "The alarm sounded and the breaker went down.",
  "軸": "Axis",
  "軸（力を伝える）": "Axis (transmitting force)",
